inl fsx_free () = Task ("FSX-FREE", "Iterate until spiral lib/spiral/*.fsx (common, sm, crypto, date_time, async_, threading, networking, platform, runtime, file_system, trace, lib) are no longer needed (user 2026-10-08): dice lib.ps1 GetFsxModulePaths/PublishFsharp, polyglot lib/fsharp/Notebooks.livemd and apps/parser #!import; restored byte-exact after the 98492a63 deletion broke dice+polyglot CI; 2026-10-08 08:2x: replaced by hand-written lib/spiral/spiral_runtime.fs (Lib facades used by consumers + new_disposable/retry_fn), trace output byte-identical to the generated stack; dice lib publishes dice.fsx alone, dice lib/fsharp + polyglot Notebooks.livemd use the runtime; verified dice both F# paths, polyglot apps/parser and lib/fsharp 6/6 with the 13 .fsx deleted; confirm on the next CI push", Feature, P0, D5, 90u32, Active, "", "fsharp,ci,spiral,polyglot,dice", "current", "current")
